he center of the Spruce Peak village, with full spa, residences + multiple restaurants - Stowe''s ultra benchmark (self-described ''4-diamond''; independent rating flagged)","earning":"chain-luxury/consortia on application","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"luxury-ultra","price_band":"~USD 400-1,200+/night peak"},{"name":"The Trapp Family Lodge (von Trapp Family Lodge & Resort)","why_ultra":"the Austrian-style 2,600-acre estate in the town of Stowe (Sound-of-Music heritage) with a premier Nordic center + on-site brewing - a distinctive ultra-character stay, separate from the ski resort","earning":"lodge-direct / consortia on application","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"luxury","price_band":"~USD 300-900+/night peak"},{"name":"Private residence + concierge + Front-Four guiding + Trapp Nordic + BTV private transfer","why_ultra":"a staffed Spruce Peak or town-of-Stowe residence + private Front-Four instruction + a Trapp Nordic day + a 45-min private airport transfer, for exclusive-use groups wanting steeps + classic-Vermont refinement","earning":"PM/villa specialists + resort + transfer","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~USD 1,000-6,000+/night whole-home peak"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-19","hero":{"query":"Stowe, United States"},"geo":{"lat":44.5319,"lng":-72.7875},"orbit":[{"id":"killington-vermont","jewels":32,"si":["ski","entertainment","culinary","family","adventure","romance","wellness"]},{"id":"sugarbush-mad-river-glen-vermont","jewels":7,"si":["ski","romance","culinary","family"]},{"id":"sunday-river-sugarloaf-maine","jewels":7,"si":["ski","family","culinary","romance"]},{"id":"white-mountains-new-hampshire","jewels":9,"si":["ski","family","ultra","culinary","romance","wellness"]}],"orbit_country":["alta-utah","aspen-snowmass-colorado","beaver-creek-colorado","big-sky-montana","breckenridge-colorado","copper-mountain-colorado","crested-butte-colorado","cr