"blurb":"\"miniature golf, shuffleboard, basketball, corn hole, paddle tennis, table tennis and pickleball\"; mini golf \"Adults (13+): $7 per person / Children (5-12): $3 per person / Children under 5: Free\""},{"name":"West End boat basin","source":"https://parks.ny.gov/parks/jonesbeach/details.aspx","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["sailing","ocean","yacht"],"booking_route":"none read - day use per the park page","commission_status":"none","tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":11,"blurb":"\"The boat basin in the west end area of the park allows boaters day use.\""},{"name":"Surfing and stand-up paddleboarding","source":"https://parks.ny.gov/parks/jonesbeach/details.aspx","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["ocean","adventure"],"booking_route":"none needed - bring your own board","commission_status":"none","tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":12,"blurb":"the park allows surfing and stand-up paddleboarding \"at designated locations\", with kayak and sailboard access at Field 10 on the bay side"},{"name":"Magic of Lights at Jones Beach","source":"https://longisland.news12.com/2025/11/19/magic-of-lights-returns-to-jones-beach-with-its-brightest-display-yet/ALgNJPXoe9OElmNLs2mFb","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["family","entertainment","motoring"],"booking_route":"advance tickets from the organiser (organiser site not fetched) or at the gate","commission_status":"unknown","commission":"venue","tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":13,"blurb":"a holiday drive-through: \"The 2.5-mile experience\" with \"more than two million LED lights\"; the 2025-26 edition opened Nov. 21 and ran nightly through Jan. 3, Sun-Thu 5-10 p.m., Fri-Sat 5-11 p.m.; $30 advance, $35-$40 at the gate; a Toyota Holiday Village walk-through with Santa photos"},{"name":"Gatsby on the Ocean","source":"https://www.gatsbyontheocean.com/","accessed":"2026-10-03","si":["culinary","romance"],"booking_route":"phone (516) 78